16-d62e56fc6726" label="lyrics-like">saéculum saéculi.</l><l xml:id="m-b494e3da-d635-44da-a4d3-defc1aecdf53" facs="#m-539f8d8a-bb51-4799-a0bc-7b4b5f444416" label="lyrics-like">4. Memóriam fécit mirabilium suórum, t miséricors et miserátor</l><l xml:id="m-bf0efbcb-c14a-4979-8f5d-38493f8e74d5" facs="#m-048983a0-648f-4fc9-bc07-d0cd915af714" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus : * éscam dédit timéntibus se.</l><l xml:id="m-737336db-0ac3-46d0-8e30-b97ee9a0b867" facs="#m-397380f3-bd98-4f3f-8990-f1dbd107a01b" label="lyrics-like">5. Mémor érit in saéculum testaménti súi: * virtútem óperum</l><l xml:id="m-4aeb770d-c07c-4c83-8888-01741569e183" facs="#m-eb8867d8-a585-48c9-81e6-2c757176f367" label="lyrics-like">suórum annuntiábit pópulo súo:</l><l xml:id="m-545897c8-4868-4704-b37a-141c14610276" facs="#m-87592701-ab5d-4487-89b7-a7305ae661f4" label="lyrics-like">6. Ut det illis haereditátem géntium:“opera mánuum éjus véritas</l><l xml:id="m-cd04d659-21c0-416b-aa26-86e0656a4dfe" facs="#m-994fab5a-748f-4a80-9c39-60778b621f6d" label="ambiguous">et judicium.</l><l xml:id="m-841112f7-acc9-4d2b-ba7c-a1f8e00a6ed1" facs="#m-23ba1be8-b164-4faa-b07a-bacfe5dd07b0" label="lyrics-like">7. Fidélia ómnia mandáta éjus: t confirmáta in saéculum saéculi:</l><l xml:id="m-e8df8c54-8256-4a08-b9a1-09c69246b10d" facs="#m-bc3e0727-6667-4473-b2ed-4cb23c9a1c0e" label="lyrics-like">fâcta in veritáte et cequitâte.</l><l xml:id="m-006703e0-2d3d-4655-9ba1-58095c1e063f" facs="#m-d04acc60-0a05-4a46-96a0-1311b4864a15" label="lyrics-like">8. Redemptiónem mísit pópulo súo:*mandávit in aetérnum testa¬</l><l xml:id="m-69c4f70e-1529-4012-a4f7-cd597b0d9bae" facs="#m-48737cbf-2e11-4578-acad-e3612ad73131" label="lyrics-like">méntum súum.</l><l xml:id="m-d62165f7-75d6-4572-a252-de731053fd38" facs="#m-3c283505-827a-44d2-bfee-1b03f5491c14" label="lyrics-like">9. Sánctum et terrsbile nómen éjus:* initium sapiéntiae timor</l><l xml:id="m-dbdfb18a-1bf4-4670-85bd-faf4b564e49c" facs="#m-fc038ada-f86b-4a4e-9dbe-3a1f3c26e7ad" label="lyrics-like">Dómini.</l><l xml:id="m-1728f480-c076-4cce-acd9-8c346fe82642" facs="#m-60440a77-867e-4d5c-8c04-28f368ffa8cf" label="lyrics-like">10. Intelléctus bónus ómnibus faciéntibus éum:“laudátio éjus mánet</l><l xml:id="m-70e1c610-8ee6-4b7d-ba1a-643e4d9a6dec" facs="#m-8fc1423e-23b9-4c45-9a02-3340248939fa" label="lyrics-like">in saéculum saéculi.</l><l xml:id="m-607fa879-7889-4b3d-8966-b70f0ce54b2a" facs="#m-017bf94b-3576-4729-b91d-4499f525c528" label="lyrics-like">11. Glória Patri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-161e42fd-2ce0-4d61-9658-b8b4b68ae8e6" facs="#m-f0cc7e85-7bb3-41fd-9cd4-36d03b633cbb" label="lyrics-like">12. Sicut érat in principio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-7369f845-acf7-4733-bc1e-d35ea348d122" facs="#m-a29047ba-e77b-4fab-acbf-2f1ba9052487" label="ambiguous">lorum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-91bc678a-9e81-4b96-8f7b-c27fd12f4e40" facs="#m-e0b59656-8d7e-4513-9d1e-2aec88e3361e" label="ambiguous">Psalm 11I. Beatus vir.</l><l xml:id="m-4a37149c-02e5-40a5-92a3-488b394a854d" facs="#m-0bad8c07-2142-434f-912d-391c57f17a78" label="ambiguous">Tone 1. D, D, Dr, f, g, gr, a, as, as.</l><l xml:id="m-35246377-6517-4d77-befe-a86add2e49c1" facs="#m-1d0d12c5-4aa2-4df7-a700-519b5af3a0d9" label="text-like">Mediant of z accents.</l><l xml:id="m-99a2a804-b0e6-4a26-a8d6-bc7b246c2012" facs="#m-a2438d4a-21f9-4af9-ba67-12612233bd27" label="text-like">Endings of1 accent with z prepar¬</l><l xml:id="m-fbcefe6c-dfb3-43e6-bdd3-e2208b010b3a" facs="#m-fc3f804c-2dfd-4159-bc84-282b540c5da8" label="text-like">tory syllablez (For the endinr De. "</l><l xml:id="m-1d0076cd-3cf8-4774-91ef-08fa72dc1402" facs="#m-f96d1fc0-6daf-47e0-987d-8c183861d509" label="text-like">extra note is added in anticipation</l><l xml:id="m-993fa257-2eb1-4c95-a529-24d04d1ce1b7" facs="#m-b3f0ef20-0a0e-4246-b1fa-ed32ec80a8fd" label="text-like">the accent in dactylic cadences)</l><l xml:id="m-1295a212-b680-4281-